As of June 30, 2026, we had approximately $2,038,000 of cash and cash equivalents and had working capital of approximately $1,918,000 (which includes a liability for approximately $213,000 of compensation that is deferred for payment until the closing of a business combination). We expect to incur significant costs in the pursuit of our acquisition and financing plans. We cannot assure you that our plans to raise capital or to complete our Initial Business Combination will be successful.

